{"id": 32, "ts": 1780488792.6901572, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I remain aligned with James and keep Candidate\u202fC as my provisional recommendation. The core safety\u2011critical criteria for long\u2011distance operations\u2014rapid, correct decision\u2011making, calmness under pressure, and strong technical competence\u2014are clearly demonstrated by C (quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, excellent attention and technical understanding). While his communication difficulties and egocentric attitude are genuine concerns, his demonstrated concern for others and high attention accuracy suggest these can be managed through targeted onboarding and coaching. In contrast, we still lack any concrete evidence of operational reliability or stress resilience for Candidate\u202fA, and we have no data on Candidate\u202fD\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation. Candidate\u202fB, although conscientious and stress\u2011resilient, shows pretentiousness and tone issues that could also impair crew harmony. Given the current evidence, C offers the strongest overall safety profile, provided we address his communication style."}
