{"id": 36, "ts": 1780488836.2141688, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the best overall fit.  As James and Emily have highlighted, C consistently makes correct decisions quickly, stays calm in a crisis, and understands complicated technology\u2014core safety\u2011critical competencies for long\u2011distance flights.  Moreover, we have explicit evidence that C is 100\u202f% reliable and creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, and his excellent attention skills further support his operational accuracy.  While his communication difficulties, egocentric attitude, and limited willingness to pursue further education are genuine concerns, they are secondary to the decisive safety profile he demonstrates and can be addressed through targeted onboarding and coaching.  In contrast, we still lack concrete evidence of operational reliability for A, stress\u2011resilience for A and D, and crew\u2011cooperation for D, and B\u2019s interpersonal issues appear more pronounced.  Therefore, I provisionally recommend Candidate\u202fC, with a plan to mitigate his communication style during onboarding."}
